[{"id":"linux-a10-perf-strace","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["perf","strace"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候用 perf，什么时候用 strace？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>perf 适合采样 CPU 热点和硬件统计，strace 适合观察系统调用、错误和等待；两者都有开销。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先用低开销工具定位，再选择深入手段：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>问题\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>工具\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>观察结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>哪段 CPU 代码最热\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>perf stat\u003c/code> / \u003ccode>perf record\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>采样热点与硬件计数\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>在等什么系统资源\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>strace -tt -T\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>系统调用、错误与等待时长\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">perf \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">stat\u003c/span> -p &lt;PID&gt; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sleep\u003c/span> 10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">strace -f -tt -T -p &lt;PID&gt; -o trace.log\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>两者都会扰动被测进程，尤其是高频系统调用；先限时、限 PID、限事件，并记录权限、采样版本和是否改变了原问题的时序。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a5-scope","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Shell","作用域"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>花括号与圆括号分组对变量的影响有什么不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>花括号在当前 Shell 执行，变量修改会保留；圆括号在子 Shell 执行，修改不会回到父 Shell。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两种分组的执行环境不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">value=parent\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">&#123; value=brace; &#125;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;brace=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$value\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># brace\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">value=parent\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">( value=subshell )\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;subshell=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$value\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># parent\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>花括号只组织命令，仍在当前 Shell 中执行；圆括号启动子 Shell，修改、目录切换和未导出的变量都不会回到父 Shell。把变量赋值放进管道或命令替换时，也要检查是否意外进入了子 Shell。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-15-retention-cohort-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["留存","Cohort","CTE"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":23,"articleCount":23,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>按用户首次 paid 订单月份分 cohort，计算每个 cohort 在第 0、1、2 月仍有 paid 订单的用户数，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">14\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">15\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">16\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">17\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">18\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">19\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">20\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">21\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WITH\u003c/span> first_paid \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> user_id,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">         STR_TO_DATE(DATE_FORMAT(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">MIN\u003c/span>(ordered_at), \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m-01&#x27;\u003c/span>), \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> cohort_month\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">), paid_activity \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DISTINCT\u003c/span> user_id,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">         STR_TO_DATE(DATE_FORMAT(ordered_at, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m-01&#x27;\u003c/span>), \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> activity_month\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> f.cohort_month,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       TIMESTAMPDIFF(\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">MONTH\u003c/span>, f.cohort_month, a.activity_month) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> month_number,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DISTINCT\u003c/span> f.user_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> active_users\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> first_paid \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> f\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> paid_activity \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> a \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> a.user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> f.user_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> a.activity_month \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> f.cohort_month\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> a.activity_month \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> f.cohort_month \u003cspan class=\"operator\">+\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"type\">INTERVAL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">MONTH\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> f.cohort_month, month_number\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> f.cohort_month, month_number;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这条查询把每个用户的活动折成两条时间轴：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>阶段\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>规则\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>first_paid\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只取用户最早的 \u003ccode>paid\u003c/code> 订单月，形成 cohort\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>paid_activity\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>按用户和月份去重，形成活跃月\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>连接与分组\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>用 \u003ccode>TIMESTAMPDIFF\u003c/code> 算相对月份并统计用户数\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此重复订单不会重复计数，首月也不会被待支付订单污染。当前写法只返回实际出现的月份；若产品要求固定显示第 0、1、2 月，先生成月份维度再 \u003ccode>LEFT JOIN\u003c/code> 并用 \u003ccode>COALESCE\u003c/code> 补 0。没有这个要求时不要凭空制造不存在的组合。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-runtime-gc","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","GC","CPython","引用计数"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 的垃圾回收能否保证对象何时销毁？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能保证具体时机；CPython 常用引用计数和循环 GC，但这是实现细节。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>语言只规定对象在不可达后“可以被回收”，不规定回收发生的时刻。CPython 的引用计数常让无环对象较快释放，但循环需要 GC，其他实现的策略也可能不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> gc\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> weakref\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">Node\u003c/span>: \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">pass\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">node = Node()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ref = weakref.ref(node)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">del\u003c/span> node\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(ref() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># CPython 常见为 True，但不是业务契约\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">gc.collect()          \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 只适合诊断或实验，不能代替资源管理\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>文件、锁和连接应使用 \u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 或明确 \u003ccode>close()\u003c/code>；弱引用适合不应延长对象寿命的缓存或观察关系。不要把 \u003ccode>__del__\u003c/code> 或某次 \u003ccode>gc.collect()\u003c/code> 当作确定的清理时机。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-bottle-transfer","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","水瓶","迁移"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何把杯子的测试思路迁移到水瓶？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>保留用途拆解和容量边界，重新建模旋盖、饮用口、携带密封和重复开合等水瓶特有功能。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>教学水瓶带旋盖和标定容量，先验证灌装、盖紧、携带、饮用和倒置，再验证容量刻度与重复开合。杯子的“放置稳定”可以迁移，但杯柄不再是必测，旋盖扭矩和吸管是新增追问。每条预期应写泄漏、盖状态和内容物变化，不能只复制“杯子测试通过”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a15-concept-2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["冒烟","准出"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十五)发布验证与维护测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十五)发布验证与维护测试","articlePath":"posts/269e708b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十五)发布验证与维护测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十五)发布验证与维护测试","articlePath":"posts/269e708b/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>冒烟测试通过能否直接发布？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能。冒烟只说明最小入口和依赖可用，发布还需满足高风险准出条件并处理严重缺陷、迁移、回退和剩余风险。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>核心入口可打开并不代表支付超时、权限隔离或数据恢复正确。冒烟失败通常阻塞后续回归；冒烟通过后仍需按变更影响执行针对性回归，并给出未测范围和责任人。若业务明确把冒烟作为准入门槛，也不能把它升级成“没有缺陷”的保证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a16-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["自动化","候选"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十六)自动化测试策略.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十六)自动化测试策略","articlePath":"posts/b843aa71/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十六)自动化测试策略.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十六)自动化测试策略","articlePath":"posts/b843aa71/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>哪些用例不适合自动化？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>规则不稳定、结果难判定、环境无法隔离、一次性成本过高或需要人的探索/体验判断的用例不应直接自动化。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>自动化前计算开发与维护成本、执行频率和失败诊断收益。频繁变化的 UI 细节可能每天修选择器却没有新风险；探索新功能需要根据学习实时改变路径；外部依赖无法隔离时脚本会产生大量假失败。可以保留人工检查或把稳定的子规则下沉到接口/单元层，而不是简单“全自动/全手工”二选一。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]